  "product_info": {
    "title": "Google Pixel 10 – 6.3” OLED Display, Google Tensor G5, 12GB RAM",
    "description": "The Google Pixel 10 redefines smartphone intelligence with its Tensor G5 processor, delivering unmatched speed, efficiency, and AI-driven personalization. Its vibrant 6.3-inch OLED display with 120Hz refresh rate ensures fluid visuals and lifelike colors, while the 4970mAh battery provides reliable all-day power and fast-charging support reaching 55% in just 30 minutes. <br><br> Built with <b>Gemini AI</b>, the Pixel 10 helps you screen calls, translate in real time, and remove distractions from photos using Magic Eraser. The advanced <b>triple-lens camera system</b> offers 20x Super Res Zoom and Night Sight for crystal-clear shots in any light. Designed from premium materials, it’s durable, water-resistant, and features enhanced security with automatic device lock and spam call protection. <br><br> Running <b>Android 16</b>, the Pixel 10 guarantees <b>seven years of OS and security updates</b>, keeping your phone secure and fresh for the long haul. Plus, enjoy up to <b>six months of free Google One Premium, Fitbit Premium,</b> and <b>YouTube Premium</b> to unlock the full Google ecosystem experience.",
